// Base64-encoded vendored font bytes (see OFL-LICENSE.txt in this directory
// for attribution). Inlined as string constants rather than read from disk at
// runtime: every filesystem-path-based approach (require.resolve, an
// import.meta.url-relative URL, import.meta.dirname) got mangled by the
// Next.js/Turbopack dev bundler in a different way each time. A plain
// string constant is not a module-resolution or filesystem-path construct,
// so no bundler has anything to statically analyze or rewrite.

